@startuml Expansion_Visibility
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title ActiveContext - Expansion and Visibility Model

state "Expansion (on NodeView)" as Exp {

  state "HEADER" as H : Metadata only\n~50 tokens
  state "CONTENT" as C : Main content/summary\nDefault for groups
  state "INDEX" as I : Content + section headings
  state "ALL" as A : Full content + children\nDefault for text views

  [*] --> A : default (text)
  [*] --> C : default (group)

  H --> C : view.expansion = CONTENT
  H --> I : view.expansion = INDEX
  H --> A : view.expansion = ALL

  C --> H : view.expansion = HEADER
  C --> I : view.expansion = INDEX
  C --> A : view.expansion = ALL

  I --> H : view.expansion = HEADER
  I --> C : view.expansion = CONTENT
  I --> A : view.expansion = ALL

  A --> H : view.expansion = HEADER
  A --> C : view.expansion = CONTENT
  A --> I : view.expansion = INDEX
}

note right of H
  **HEADER**
  - Title + node type
  - Token counts
  - Basic metadata
  - Children NOT rendered
end note

note right of C
  **CONTENT**
  - Main node content
  - Summary if available
  - Children NOT rendered
  - Good for groups
end note

note right of I
  **INDEX**
  - Content + child headers
  - Navigation outline
  - Children partially rendered
end note

note right of A
  **ALL**
  - Full content
  - Children fully rendered
  - Maximum information
end note

state "Visibility (on NodeView)" as Vis {

  state "Visible" as V : view.hidden = False\nAppears in projection
  state "Hidden" as HID : view.hidden = True\nNot in projection

  [*] --> V : default

  V --> HID : view.hidden = True
  HID --> V : view.hidden = False
}

note right of HID
  **Hidden nodes:**
  - Not rendered to projection
  - Still ticked if running
  - State preserved
  - Children also hidden
end note

legend right
  **Key Concepts**

  | Concept | Owner | Controls |
  | default_expansion | ContextNode | Initial expansion |
  | expansion | NodeView | Current expansion |
  | hidden | NodeView | Visibility |

  **Rendering Rules**
  | Expansion | Self | Children |
  | HEADER | Yes | No |
  | CONTENT | Yes | No |
  | INDEX | Yes | Headers only |
  | ALL | Yes | Full |

  Hidden nodes: Never rendered
  (regardless of expansion)
endlegend

@enduml
